### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health


### Get current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me


### Get all subjects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects


### Create subject
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ktor",
  "description": "Разработка серверной части на Kotlin"
}


### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks


### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Сделать серверную часть",
  "description": "Реализовать REST API на Ktor",
  "subject": "Ktor",
  "deadline": "2026-06-10",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "type": "COURSE_WORK"
}


### Search tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?query=сервер


### Filter tasks by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=PLANNED


### Filter tasks by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?priority=HIGH


### Get tasks for today
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/today


### Get tasks for week
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/week


### Get tasks by subject
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/by-subject?subject=Ktor


### Update task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Обновить серверную часть",
  "description": "Доработать PostgreSQL-репозитории",
  "subject": "Ktor",
  "deadline": "2026-06-20",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "type": "COURSE_WORK"
}


### Update task status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}


### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2